$$SYNTAX-LEVEL 2
*(mgdb-project-fowler-insertion-validation
<a class="mgdb-skip-link" href="#fw-main">Skip to main content</a>
<main class="mgdb-page mgdb-hub-page mgdb-resource-page mgdb-fw-page" id="fw-main">

  <nav class="mgdb-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
